\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Poland \highlight\uc2  May  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  Again to Curb Zloty Volatility - \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Governor\b0\par\par\uc2 By Patryk Wasilewski   \par \uc2 488 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 2013\par 10:23\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 WARSAW--\b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may again \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to limit the Polish zloty's volatility, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Marek Belka told state news agency PAP late Friday, hours after the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market for the first time since December 2011.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday took the market by surprise as it came only two days after the governor said the recent weakening of the zloty was a welcome trend as it helped the slowing economy regain competitiveness.\par \par \uc2 "We never pre-announce these things, and if someone thought that we will not do it then I am sorry, but we do not act in the interest of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market speculators," Mr. Belka said. "Somebody thought he will make money on the zloty weakening and got burned."\par \par \uc2 As a result of the bank's actions the zloty strengthened to around 4.23 against the euro from above 4.30 before the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's finance ministry\uc2  and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have a history of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. When both institutions acted to strengthen the zloty in 2011 the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not only weaker against the euro than it is now, but the country's public debt was closer to an automatic austerity threshold of 55% of GDP.\par \par \uc2 However, recent fiscal tightening has pushed the debt level to 52.7% of GDP in 2012 while the government changed the way it values its foreign debt pile, limiting the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market's impact on debt size.\par \par \uc2 "The timing is quite strange given Governor Belka tried to talk the zloty down during the press conference on Wednesday. He said the PLN weakening was very welcome and hasn't influenced the recent rate cut at all," ING economist Rafal Benecki wrote Friday.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Belka explained that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's goal was not to defend some specific zloty level but rather curb recent volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which pushed it to the weakest level in a year against the euro on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "This absolutely isn't an attempt to fight a trend or anything, things just got a little wild recently and we had to give [the market] a kick," Mr. Belka said.\par \par \uc2 The zloty, Polish bonds and other emerging market assets have been under immense pressure since the Federal Reserve indicated late last month that it may consider unwinding its bond-buying stimulus program if the U.S. economy continues to improve.\par \par \uc2 The prospect of tighter policy in the U.S. has prompted investors to exit riskier assets and rush to safe-haven \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bonds.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's signal that it was close to ending its rate-cutting cycle also prompted global investors to sell the country's treasury bonds.\par \par \uc2 Write to Patryk Wasilewski at patryk.wasilewski@dowjones.com [ 08-06-13 0823GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130608e9680000j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
