\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK: Governor Belka Key For PLN Wed -\uc2 Commerzbank\b0\par\par\uc2 131 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Januar 2012\par 10:24\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 0924 GMT [Dow Jones] Comments from \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Marek Belka on zloty \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be key for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday, \uc2 Commerzbank\uc2  says. The governor is due to speak in the afternoon after a regular monthly sitting of the bank's monetary council. "Should Belka signal that the NBP is still prepared to support the Polish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , this is likely to support the zloty today," \uc2 Commerzbank\uc2  says. The rate-setting panel is widely expected to keep interest rates unchanged, and such a scenario is priced in by investors. EUR/PLN trades at 4.4633. (patryk.wasilewski@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in London. +44-20-7842-9464 \par Markettalk.eu@dowjones.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 [ 11-01-12 0924GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1085   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120111e81b000k3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
