\par\par \b \uc2 DJ 2nd UPDATE: Poland Defends Zloty To Keep Public Debt At Bay\b0\par\par\uc2 464 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Dezember 2011\par 15:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 -- Polish state-owned bank bought large amounts of zloty ahead of 1000 GMT fixing\par \par \uc2 -- Zloty strengthens to PLN4.41 to euro on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , weakens again after 1000 GMT\par \par \uc2 -- \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  steps in late in session with low volumes\par \par \uc2 (adds details on debt, quotes) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Patryk Wasilewski \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 WARSAW (Dow Jones)--\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Poland\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's finance ministry \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market for a second day in a row in order to keep its foreign debt at bay and avoid the necessity of introducing painful austerity measures.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The foreign debt, making up for around one-third of Poland's total public debt, is priced based on the zloty's last fixing each year, and in order to strengthen the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  just ahead of that time the ministry's agent, BGK bank, was heavily buying zlotys.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We saw significant supply of the zloty from London, but then BGK started buying heavily," a dealer said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 As a result, the zloty was on a rollercoaster ride Friday as state-owned bank BGK soaked up zloty supply from foreign investors. But once the bank's support ceased, the zloty quickly weakened even further, hitting the session's high of PLN4.47.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The ministry later Friday announced that public debt for 2011 will be slightly below 54% of gross domestic product, not far off its 53.7% forecast, and reiterated its targets for the next year.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The ministry added it has some PLN30 billion in cash, mostly foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at its disposal.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Poland's government wants to keep total debt under 55% of gross domestic product, a level that would trigger painful austerity measures, including tax increases and quickly limiting government spending to tighten public finance.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Economists earlier estimated that the zloty would have to weaken to around PLN4.7 against the single \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in order to threaten the 55%-of-GDP debt threshold.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The finance ministry, wary that using the fixing makes it prone to market participants' speculation as they position themselves to profit from expected \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , wants to change the way public debt is valued in the future by using an average euro/zloty rate instead.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Late in the session, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was also spotted on the market, dealers said, sending a signal that even in the new year it will be ready to step in to defend the zloty from too rapid moves.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BGK's and the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Friday followed coordinated action with the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Thursday, when both institutions also stepped into the market to defend the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from weakening.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Patryk Wasilewski, Dow Jones Newswires; +48 22 447 2430; patryk.wasilewski@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 30, 2011 09:22 ET (14:22 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020111230e7cu002od\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
