\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Poland intervenes \highlight\uc2  to support zloty ahead of year-end fixing\b0\par\par\uc2 344 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 2011\par 16:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Polish c.bank and BGK step into \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  mkt to support zloty\par \par \uc2 * Fifth \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in last three months\par \par \uc2 * Zloty exchange rate key for public debt held in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 (Adds quote, detail, background)\par \par \uc2 By Dagmara Leszkowicz\par \par \uc2 WARSAW, Dec 29 (Reuters) - Poland's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and state-owned BGK bank stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday to support the zloty a day ahead of a final fixing for the year that will be key in determining the level of the national debt.\par \par \uc2 The multiple \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fifth in around three months as it seeks to limit falls in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has lost around a 10th of its value against the euro since June as investors fled riskier assets.\par \par \uc2 Poland is keen to keep a floor under the zloty to prevent its state debt, largely denominated in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , from exceeding 55 percent of gross domestic product, a level that would trigger constitutionally mandated spending cuts.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not target a specific zloty level, as its 'critical level' in terms of public debt is still far away," said Piotr Bujak, chief economist at \uc2 Nordea Bank Polska\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The bank just wanted to remind market participants about its presence and discourage those who wanted to speculate on the unit."\par \par \uc2 The public debt is expected to stand at 53.7 pct of GDP, and analysts said the 55 percent threshold would only be breached if the zloty weakened past 4.7-4.8 to the euro.\par \par \uc2 At 1700 GMT, the zloty traded at 4.405, erasing almost all of its Thursday heavy losses, when it had hit a week-low of 4.46 to the euro.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed in a statement its presence on the spot market on Thursday, while BGK declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 Trading volumes in euro/zloty were at their highest level for some weeks.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Dagmara Leszkowicz; Editing by John Stonestreet)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 POLAND\b0 \highlight\uc2 -ZLOTY/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120101e7ct000a0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
