k PKO BP\par \par \uc2 came to an end.\par \par \uc2 EMPERIA\par \par \uc2 Private equity firm \uc2 Mid Europa Partners\uc2  and Penta Investments have both bid for Polish retailer Emperia's store chain Stokrotka, with Mid Europa offering more, two sources close to the transaction told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 MONEY SUPPLY\par \par \uc2 Poland's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  releases M3 money supply data for October at 1300 GMT.\par \par \uc2 NOTE - For a diary of forthcoming events see and a calendar of east European economic indicators see .\par \par \uc2 For other related news, double click on: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Polish equities           E.Europe equities     \par Polish money              Polish debt           \par Eastern Europe             All emerging markets  \par Hot stocks                 Stock markets         \par Market debt news           \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  news            \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For real-time index quotes, double click on:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Warsaw WIG20 Budapest BUX Prague PX\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020111117e7be000bu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
