\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Polish  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Governor: Ready To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  Again\b0\par\par\uc2 300 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Oktober 2011\par 11:31\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 WARSAW (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is ready for more \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the zloty market to limit its volatility, but has no exchange target for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Marek Belka, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor, wrote in an article published Monday by Bloomberg Businessweek's Polish edition.\par \par \uc2 "The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Poland\b0 \highlight\uc2  has recently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. We decided to act when the zloty was strongly volatile and encouraged purely speculative action. We introduced an element of uncertainty to the market, hitting the expectations of potential speculators so that they don't feel unpunishable. The zloty has been more stable since then," Belka wrote.\par \par \uc2 In late September, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the zloty, weakened by the fallout of euro-zone sovereign debt concerns, when it was around PLN4.50 to the euro. It has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice since the original \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . At 0845 GMT on Monday, the zloty was at PLN4.26 to the euro.\par \par \uc2 Belka also said stability of monetary policy was important for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which left its interest rates unchanged at the October meeting after raising rates four times earlier this year to bring elevated consumer price inflation down. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will fight inflation, but not in an erratic way, "by tightening the screws too much in order to loosen them too much soon after," he said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's benchmark rate is at 4.5%, while Poland's inflation in September fell to 3.9% on the year after peaking at 5% in May.\par \par \uc2 Article link: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bbwp.pl/artykul/marek-belka-polska-zasluguje-na-wiecej/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.bbwp.pl/artykul/marek-belka-polska-zasluguje-na-wiecej/ }}}\par \par \uc2 -Warsaw Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; +48 22 447 2432\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 17, 2011 05:31 ET (09:31 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020111017e7ah00253\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
